{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24701","headline":"自问此心呈诸老伴 · 白居易","name":"自问此心呈诸老伴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝问此心何所思，暮问此心何所爲。\n不入公门慵歛手，不看人面免低眉。\n居士室间眠得所，少年场上饮非宜。\n闲谈亹亹留诸老，美酝徐徐进一巵。\n心未曾求过分事，身常少有不安时。\n此心除自谋身外，更问其余尽不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}